    "title": "111 angel number",
    "text": "[ wuhn wuhn wuhn ] October 6, 2023 What does the angel number 111 mean? In numerology, 111 is considered to be an angel number that is said to represent opportunity, good luck, and achievement. Numerology is the study of numbers coupled with a belief that numbers have significance in people’s lives and can be omens of the future. The term angel number is used in numerology to refer to a number with repeating digits, which is considered to have special importance. In numerology, the number 1 is typically thought to represent opportunity, determination, creation, and self-improvement. So, the number 111 is typically seen as a sign that a person is going to see opportunity, meet with good fortune, achieve a goal they have been working on, or experience a new beginning. 111 is an enhanced version of 1, so numerologists suggest that 111 is a sign that people who are working toward a goal or trying to improve themselves are on the right path. Where does 111 angel number come from? Most sources credit the idea of angel numbers to author Doreen Virtue, who wrote about their significance in her 2005 book Angel Numbers. According to Virtue, numbers with repeated digits are used by guardian angels to communicate with people in order to guide them or give them life advice. This is likely why Virtue refers to them as angel numbers. The concept of numerology in general is much older. The idea that the number 1 is an important number that represents creation, for example, can be traced back at least to the Pythagoreans of ancient Greece. Examples of 111 angel number 111 is HAUNTING ME. like I can't escape this angel number but idk what it's trying to tell me im seeing it everywhere @knbxos, October 1, 2023 The angel number 111 is associated with boosted confidence as well as stronger motivation and decision-making. When this number keeps popping up in your life, it is thought to mean that you are on the right track to receiving these associations! Vanessa Hall, Parade, September 7, 2023 Who uses 111 angel number? People who practice or are interested in numerology are most likely to know that 111 is an angel number and consider it to be significant. Personal Angel Number Sighting: Spotted 111 on a license plate while stuck in traffic. A reminder that new beginnings are on the horizon. 🚗👼 — Jen Burke – Angel Stories Weekly (@ourangelstories) September 14, 2023 i keep seeing 111 as my angel number and lady bugs keep flying into the apartment, PLEASE I DONT WANNA TAKE ANY RISKS OR FIND LOVE RN — dana! (@dana_dang_) August 22, 2023 #LibraSeason is here! Did you know 111 is an angel number of awakening and enlightenment? Libras, it's your time to shine and align with your higher purpose. — DecodeVale (@DecodeVale) September 21, 2023 NOTE This is not meant to be a formal definition of 111 angel number like most terms we define on Dictionary.com, but is rather an informal word summary that hopefully touches upon the key aspects of the meaning and usage of 111 angel number that will help our users expand their word mastery.",
